graph TD
    A[Start with target course] --> B{Check if student has completed the course}
    B -->|Yes| C{All prerequisites met?}
    C -->|No| D[Traverse each prerequisite]
    D --> E{Check if prerequisite is in academic history}
    E -->|No| F[Mark as not eligible]
    E -->|Yes| G{Continue until all prerequisites are checked}
    G --> H{Return true}
    B -->|No| I{Add course to queue for traversal}
    I --> J{Process next course in queue}
    J --> K{Check if student has completed the course}
    K -->|No| L[Mark as not eligible]
    K -->|Yes| M{Continue until all prerequisites are checked}